    // 2. Top-K partial sort in registers
    // 3. Atomic scatter to expert buffer (shared mem + global atomics)
    // 4. Shared memory count reduce to global
    // 4+ kernel launches → 1 kernel launch, 无中间 global memory roundtrip
}
```

